  type_alias_unit.pcpp - Type fixture: a unit the alias and pointer tests import

  An exported type (TKind = int64) and an exported variable (GUnitCount):
  type_alias uses the type qualified, type_alias_err_module /
  type_alias_err_unit_var / type_pointer_err_qualified_star break on them.
